                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who were the people who heard God's voice and rebelled against him? All those who were led out of Egypt by Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With whom was God angry for forty years? With the people who sinned, who fell down dead in the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When God made his solemn promise, “They will never enter the land where I would have given them rest” — of whom was he speaking? Of those who rebelled. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We see, then, that they were not able to enter the land, because they did not believe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
